<view class="container">
  <view class="card muted">
    对应设计稿「油站选择」「邀请加入」两个画板。当前 yeweiyi-cloud 是单账号 + 三级角色模型，没有
    "油站"这层分组，也没有"邀请其他账号共享设备"的机制——这不是接口参数缺失，是数据模型缺一层，
    这里全部是本地静态数据，不会真的请求。
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">油站选择</view>
  <view class="card" style="padding:16rpx 24rpx;">
    <view class="field-input row" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-bottom:0;">
      <image src="/assets/icons/org-search.png" mode="aspectFit" style="width:28rpx;height:28rpx;margin-right:12rpx;" />
      <input placeholder="输入加油站查询" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="onKeywordInput" style="flex:1;" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" style="padding:0 24rpx;">
    <view
      wx:for="{{filteredStations}}"
      wx:key="name"
      class="list-row"
      data-name="{{item.name}}"
      bindtap="onStationTap"
    >
      <image class="list-row-icon-plain" src="/assets/icons/org-location.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <view class="list-row-body">
        <text>{{item.name}}</text>
        <view class="muted" style="margin-top:4rpx;">{{item.address}}</view>
      </view>
      <text class="text-selected-mark" wx:if="{{activeStation === item.name}}">✓</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">邀请加入</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="list-row" bindtap="onWechatInvite" style="padding-top:8rpx;">
      <image class="list-row-icon-plain" src="/assets/icons/org-wechat.png" mode="aspectFit" />
      <view class="list-row-body">
        <text>微信邀请</text>
        <view class="muted" style="margin-top:4rpx;">共同管理、使用智能设备与场景</view>
      </view>
      <image class="list-row-chevron" src="/assets/icons/chevron-right.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <view class="field" style="margin-top:16rpx;">
      <view class="row" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-bottom:8rpx;">
        <image src="/assets/icons/org-phone.png" mode="aspectFit" style="width:32rpx;height:32rpx;margin-right:12rpx;" />
        <text class="field-label" style="margin-bottom:0;">手机号邀请</text>
      </view>
      <input class="field-input" type="number" placeholder="请输入对方手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhoneInput" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onPhoneInvite">邀请</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card muted">
    员工管理：设计稿里这个画板本身是空的（图层树 0 个子节点），暂无可参照的设计。
  </view>
</view>
